From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryan Hoban <bryan.hoban@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:42:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] RPi5: kodi: composite subtitles into the Dolby Vision
 signal

Subtitles drawn over the tunnel frame by the display come out in wrong
colours, since the TV decodes them as signal. Draw them offscreen and
let the engine composite them into the picture's signal.

Signed-off-by: Bryan Hoban <bryan.hoban@gmail.com>
---
